    <param.description>G-PEARL is a MATLAB-based application designed to support scientific investigations of GNSS data across multiple data formats. It enables the processing of both raw signal samples and observables, providing automated report generation for a range of scientific analyses, including multi-frequency and multi-constellation GNSS signal acquisition, total electron content estimation, multipath analysis from observables, and state estimation solutions.</param.description>
